            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1223183,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "KR-MoonCliffs-NPC04_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "When the Shadow Queen conquered the Eclipse Tower, she allowed Shadow magic to flow in and corrupt the Moon magic.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Mice_Summoner_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_KHR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/SofiaDarkSide_KHR_06.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1223183,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "KR-MoonCliffs-NPC04_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Now the two are forever intertwined in this place. Moon magic is about changing forms. But Shadow magic is about rebuilding reality.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Mice_Summoner_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_KHR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/SofiaDarkSide_KHR_07.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1223183,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "KR-MoonCliffs-NPC04_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Shadow magic is dangerous and was forbidden throughout the Spiral. But you must learn it, if you wish to fight legends.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Mice_Summoner_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_KHR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/SofiaDarkSide_KHR_08.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1223183,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "KR-MoonCliffs-NPC04_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Ascend the Eclipse Tower again. You will see new threats, but may expand your mind. It is my honor to teach you. I dearly hope you survive.",
